SUMMARY:Comedy Show in Brooklyn LIVE at Eastville Comedy Club
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nGet Tickets \nAbout the Show\nBe ready to laugh the night away at NYC’s historic Eastville Comedy Club! Featuring New York locals and visiting headliners in a current rotation of lineups\, every night is guaranteed to be unique and different\, but always filled with laughter. \nA great way to start a night out in Brooklyn\, the Eastville offers signature crafted cocktails with no minimum purchase necessary\, so you can sip while you roar with laughter alongside amazing performers. \nEvent Details\nDate: Various dates and times available (select during purchase)\nTime: 8:00 PM (entry from 8:00 PM until 9:30 PM)\nDuration: Approximately 1 hour and 30 minutes\nLocation: Eastville Comedy Club\, 487 Atlantic Avenue\, Brooklyn\, NY 11217\nAge Requirement: All ages welcome; must be 21+ with valid ID to purchase or consume alcohol \nAbout the Venue\nEastville Comedy Club is located at 487 Atlantic Avenue in Brooklyn\, NY. This historic venue is easily accessible via the Atlantic Ave B/Q subway stop\, Nevins St 2/3/4/5\, and Hoyt-Schermerhorn A/C/G stations. \nWhat to Expect\nLaugh all night alongside featured headliners at the historic Eastville Comedy Club. Enjoy specialty crafted cocktails with no drink minimum\, and pair your drink with delicious snacks. It’s a great way to experience Brooklyn nightlife. \nTicket Information\nTickets start from $11.99. General Admission for 1 — Laughs for 2 at Eastville Comedy Club. No booking fees. All ages welcome. \nGet Tickets
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/comedy-show-in-brooklyn-live-at-eastville-comedy-club-2/
LOCATION:Eastville Comedy Club\, 487 Atlantic Avenue\, Brooklyn\, NY\, 11217\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://applications-media.feverup.com/image/upload/f_auto,w_720,h_720/fever2/plan/photo/78eb1e88-ae43-11ed-bc62-42ef34ab7d27.jpg
