SUMMARY:Comedy Show + Mini-Golf Experience LIVE at High Line Comedy Club
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nGet Tickets \nAbout the Show\nHigh Line Comedy Club is a premier stand-up venue on Manhattan’s West Side\, featuring top comedians seen on Netflix\, HBO\, Comedy Central\, The Tonight Show with Jimmy Fallon\, The Late Show with Stephen Colbert\, and The Daily Show with Jon Stewart. \nTucked away inside an immersive mini-golf venue\, High Line Comedy Club is a hidden gem in NYC’s comedy scene offering a one-of-a-kind entertainment experience. The lineup includes both established headliners and rising stars delivering top-tier performances night after night. \nEvent Details\nDate: Select your dates directly in the ticket selector\nTime: 7pm & 9pm show times\nLocation: High Line Comedy Club\, 446 W 14th St\, New York\, NY 10014\nAge Requirement: 21+ only\nNote: 1 item (food or drink) purchase minimum \nAbout the Venue\nHigh Line Comedy Club is located at 446 West 14th Street in New York’s vibrant Meatpacking District. With rooftop views\, a fantastic menu of food\, and a vibrant atmosphere\, the club offers a high-energy\, intimate setting for unforgettable live comedy. \nWhat to Expect\nExpect a night of world-class stand-up comedy from comedians you’ve seen on Netflix\, HBO\, and Comedy Central. The unique mini-golf setting adds an extra layer of fun to your evening out in NYC. \nShows run at 7pm and 9pm\, so you can choose the time that works best for you. Arrive early to grab a drink and settle in for a great night of laughs. \nTicket Information\nTickets start from $26.00. Early Bird tickets are available at a discount. Age limit strictly 21+. All sales are final. \nGet Tickets
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/comedy-show-mini-golf-experience-live-at-high-line-comedy-club/
LOCATION:High Line Comedy Club\, 446 West 14th Street\, New York\, NY\, 10014\, United States
