SUMMARY:Jim Florentine LIVE at Bricktown Comedy Club Tulsa
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nJim Florentine LIVE at Bricktown Comedy Club Tulsa\nGet ready for a night of raw\, unfiltered comedy as Jim Florentine takes the stage at Bricktown Comedy Club Tulsa. Known for his sharp wit\, brutally honest observations\, and no-holds-barred delivery\, Florentine is one of stand-up comedy’s most authentic voices. \nEvent Details\nDate: Wednesday\, August 19\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM (Doors open 6:00 PM)\nVenue: Bricktown Comedy Club Tulsa\nAddress: 5982 S Yale Ave\, Tulsa\, OK 74135\nAge Requirement: 18+ Only\nTicket Prices: $68 – $127 (General Admission & VIP) \nAbout Jim Florentine\nJim Florentine is a veteran stand-up comedian\, podcast host\, and television personality best known for his appearances on Howard Stern\, Opie & Anthony\, and as a co-host of VH1 Classic’s That Metal Show. With a career spanning over two decades\, Florentine has built a devoted following with his unapologetically honest\, blue-collar humor that tackles everyday life with fearless candor. He has released multiple stand-up specials and continues to tour nationally to sold-out crowds. \nWhat to Expect\n\nRaw\, unfiltered stand-up comedy with no topic off-limits\nSharp observations on relationships\, pop culture\, and everyday life\nIntimate comedy club atmosphere at Bricktown Comedy Club\nOne of stand-up’s most authentic and fearless voices\nAn unforgettable night of laughs in Tulsa\, Oklahoma\n\nVenue Information\nBricktown Comedy Club Tulsa is Tulsa’s premier destination for live stand-up comedy\, located at 5982 S Yale Ave. The intimate venue features a full bar and dining menu\, ensuring a complete entertainment experience. No seat is far from the stage\, making every show feel up-close and personal. \nTicket Information\nTickets for Jim Florentine at Bricktown Comedy Club Tulsa start at $68 for General Admission and go up to $127 for VIP General Admission. Only 44 tickets remain — don’t miss out! \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you.\nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/jim-florentine-live-at-bricktown-comedy-club-tulsa/
LOCATION:Bricktown Comedy Club\, 5982 S Yale Ave\, Tulsa\, OK\, 74135\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://comedycalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/jim-florentine-tickets-1-YCPj9c.jpg
GEO:36.0773128;-95.9241109
