SUMMARY:Nick Alex LIVE at Cobb's Comedy Club
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nNick Alex is a rising stand-up comedian making a name for himself on the national comedy circuit with his sharp\, observational humor and confident stage presence. Known for his clever writing and relatable material\, Nick Alex has been building a loyal fanbase through relentless touring and standout performances at top comedy clubs across the country. \nHis comedy style blends smart observations with personal storytelling\, delivered with a natural ease that makes even the most complex setups feel effortless. Whether riffing on everyday life or diving into more personal territory\, Nick Alex consistently delivers laughs that resonate with audiences of all backgrounds. \nThis one-night-only show at Cobb’s Comedy Club is a great opportunity to catch a comedian on the rise before he’s selling out much bigger rooms. Don’t miss it. \nEvent Details\nDate: Wednesday\, August 19\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM PDT\nVenue: Cobb’s Comedy Club\, 915 Columbus Avenue\, San Francisco\, CA 94133\nAge Restriction: 18+ / 2 Beverage Minimum\nTicket Price Range: $28 – $52 \nAbout the Venue\nCobb’s Comedy Club is one of San Francisco’s most iconic comedy venues\, located at 915 Columbus Avenue in the vibrant North Beach neighborhood. With a capacity of approximately 400 guests\, Cobb’s offers an intimate setting where every seat delivers a great view of the stage. \nThe club features a full bar and dining service\, with cocktails\, beer\, wine\, and food available throughout the show. The classic comedy club layout — tables and chairs arranged around a central stage — creates a warm\, communal atmosphere that amplifies every punchline. \nCobb’s is easily accessible by BART and Muni\, and parking is available in nearby garages throughout the North Beach area. It’s the perfect venue for a memorable night of stand-up comedy in San Francisco. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is a solo stand-up performance by Nick Alex — a full evening of his signature observational comedy. Expect a well-crafted\, engaging set with sharp writing and plenty of big laughs from start to finish. \nThe 18+ age restriction and 2-beverage minimum are in effect. Doors open approximately 30–45 minutes before showtime. Arrive early to grab a great seat and settle in with a drink before the show begins. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $28 – $52 (before taxes and fees)\nTickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale). \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/nick-alex-live-at-cobbs-comedy-club/
LOCATION:Cobb’s Comedy Club\, 915 Columbus Avenue\, San Francisco\, California\, 94133\, United States Of America
