SUMMARY:Don McMillan 2.0 LIVE at Punch Line Comedy Club - Sacramento
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nDon McMillan 2.0 (Now Powered By AI) LIVE at Punch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento\nTech comedian Don McMillan brings his brand-new show “Don McMillan 2.0 (Now Powered By AI)” to Punch Line Comedy Club in Sacramento on August 19\, 2026! A former Silicon Valley engineer turned stand-up comedian\, Don McMillan is famous for his hilarious PowerPoint presentations and tech-themed comedy that appeals to everyone. \nEvent Details\nDate: Wednesday\, August 19\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM (Doors open at 6:30 PM)\nVenue: Punch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento\nAddress: 2100 Arden Way\, Sacramento\, CA 95825\nAge Requirement: 18+ with valid government-issued photo ID\nBeverage Minimum: 2 beverages per person \nAbout Don McMillan\nDon McMillan is a comedian and former engineer known for his clever tech humor\, PowerPoint comedy\, and unique blend of engineering and stand-up. His viral videos and TV appearances have made him a fan favorite\, and his new show “2.0 (Now Powered By AI)” takes his signature style to hilarious new heights with fresh material about artificial intelligence and modern technology. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHilarious tech-themed stand-up comedy\nBrand-new AI-powered material from the 2.0 tour\nClever PowerPoint-style comedy presentations\nRelatable humor for tech lovers and non-techies alike\nIntimate club atmosphere at Sacramento’s premier comedy venue\nFull bar service with 2-beverage minimum\n\nVenue Information\nPunch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento is located at 2100 Arden Way in Sacramento\, CA. One of the top comedy clubs in Northern California\, it features a full bar\, great sightlines\, and ample free parking in the shopping center lot. \nTicket Information\nTickets start from $38. This is an 18+ event with a 2-beverage minimum per person. Tickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) or VividSeats (resale). \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
