SUMMARY:Island Magic Mike LIVE at San Jose Improv
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nIsland Magic Mike\, born Mike Garcia\, is a stand-up comedian and content creator born and raised on the North Shore of O’ahu\, Hawaii. Known as the class clown growing up\, Mike turned his natural gift for making people laugh into a full-time career\, building a loyal fanbase through his hilarious and relatable TikTok and Instagram skits. \nMike’s comedy is rooted in his Hawaiian upbringing\, island culture\, and the universal experiences of everyday life. His positive\, infectious energy is impossible to resist\, and his live shows leave audiences with big smiles and lasting memories. He has sold out iconic Hawaiian venues including The Blue Note Hawaii and the Hawaii Theatre\, and has appeared in commercials and emceed numerous events across the islands. \nNow bringing his act to the mainland\, Island Magic Mike is making waves on the national comedy circuit. His warm\, high-energy style is a refreshing change of pace\, and his San Jose Improv debut is not to be missed. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Wednesday\, August 19\, 2026\nShow Time: 8:00 PM PDT (Doors open at 6:30 PM)\nVenue: San Jose Improv\, 62 S Second St\, San Jose\, CA 95113\nAge Restriction: 21+ Event – Valid ID required at the door\nContent: Stand-up comedy – warm\, high-energy\, and full of island spirit\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe San Jose Improv is the Bay Area’s top stand-up comedy club\, located in the heart of downtown San Jose at 62 S Second St. As part of the nationally renowned Improv comedy club chain\, the venue has been a cornerstone of Silicon Valley’s comedy scene\, hosting both rising stars and established headliners night after night. \nThe intimate club setting puts every audience member close to the stage\, creating a warm and lively atmosphere that perfectly complements Island Magic Mike’s high-energy performance style. The venue offers a full bar and dining menu\, with a mandatory two-item minimum per guest in the showroom. Seating is general admission and first-come\, first-served except for groups and premium booths\, so plan to arrive early. \nThe San Jose Improv is easily accessible from downtown San Jose\, with multiple parking garages and public transit options nearby. It is the perfect midweek destination for a night of great laughs. \nWhat to Expect\nExpect a high-energy\, feel-good night of stand-up comedy that brings the spirit of Hawaii straight to Silicon Valley. Island Magic Mike’s show is a solo headlining performance packed with stories from island life\, observations on mainland culture\, and the kind of infectious positivity that makes you feel like you just got back from vacation. \nHis comedy is accessible and warm\, perfect for a wide range of audiences. Whether you are already a fan from his viral social media content or discovering him for the first time\, you are in for a treat. Mike’s stage presence is electric\, and his ability to connect with a crowd is something special. \nThis is a 21+ event. Bring your ID\, enjoy the two-item minimum\, and get ready to laugh. No phones\, no photography\, no recording during the show. Just pure aloha spirit and great comedy. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $25 – $90 (plus fees) \n\nGA Ticket: $25 (plus fees)\nVIP Ticket: $40 (plus fees) – preferred seating\nGA Premium Table (seats 4): $75 (plus fees) – includes $200 food and beverage credit\nVIP Premium Banquette (seats 4): $90 (plus fees) – includes $200 food and beverage credit\, premium viewing\n\nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/island-magic-mike-live-at-san-jose-improv/
LOCATION:San Jose Improv\, 62 S Second St\, San Jose\, California\, 95113\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://i.ticketweb.com/i/00/13/39/51/23_Edp.jpg?v=2
GEO:37.3356413;-121.8883224
