SUMMARY:Rene Vaca 2026 Tour LIVE at House of Blues Cleveland
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets\n\nAbout the Performer\nRene Vaca is one of the fastest-rising stars in stand-up comedy\, known for his sharp wit\, relatable storytelling\, and high-energy performances that leave audiences in stitches. \nBorn and raised in Southern California\, Vaca draws from his Latino heritage\, family dynamics\, and everyday life experiences to craft comedy that resonates with a wide range of audiences. His style blends observational humor with personal anecdotes\, creating a show that feels both intimate and universally funny. \nVaca has built a massive following on social media and has performed at major comedy clubs and theaters across the country. His 2026 Tour has been one of the most talked-about comedy tours of the year\, selling out venues from coast to coast. \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, August 20\, 2026 \nShow Time: 6:00 PM (Doors open at 5:00 PM) \nVenue: House of Blues Cleveland\, 308 Euclid Avenue\, Cleveland\, OH 44114 \nAge Restriction: All ages welcome (21+ for bar access) \nNote: This show was rescheduled from June 6\, 2026. Original tickets remain valid. \nAbout the Venue\nHouse of Blues Cleveland is one of the most iconic live entertainment venues in Northeast Ohio\, located in the heart of downtown Cleveland on Euclid Avenue. The venue is part of the legendary House of Blues chain\, known for its rich musical heritage\, stunning decor\, and world-class sound systems. \nThe Music Hall at House of Blues Cleveland holds approximately 1\,200 guests and features a standing floor with elevated viewing areas\, giving every fan a great sightline to the stage. The venue’s intimate atmosphere makes it perfect for comedy shows\, where every joke lands with maximum impact. \nAmenities include multiple full-service bars\, a restaurant\, and the exclusive Foundation Room for VIP guests. Parking is available in nearby garages and surface lots throughout downtown Cleveland. The venue is also easily accessible via public transit on the RTA Red Line. \nWhat to Expect\nRene Vaca’s 2026 Tour is a full-length stand-up comedy show featuring all-new material. Expect a high-energy\, laugh-out-loud performance packed with personal stories\, cultural observations\, and Vaca’s signature comedic timing. \nThe show runs approximately 90 minutes and is suitable for adult audiences. Vaca’s comedy touches on family\, relationships\, and the absurdities of modern life — all delivered with warmth and authenticity that makes his shows feel like hanging out with a hilarious friend. \nVIP upgrades including Fast Lane Access and Foundation Room Access are available through Ticketmaster for fans who want an elevated experience. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $36 – $75 (plus fees) \nSecure your seats now before they sell out — Rene Vaca’s shows have been selling out across the country on this tour! \n\nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/rene-vaca-tour-live-at-house-of-blues-cleveland-3/
LOCATION:House of Blues Cleveland\, 308 Euclid Avenue\, Cleveland\, OH\, 44114\, USA
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://media.ticketmaster.com/en-us/dam/a/2cd/62219706-ddc2-40af-bdc6-6ccf591382cd_TABLET_LANDSCAPE_LARGE_16_9.jpg
