SUMMARY:Nick Alex LIVE at Punch Line Comedy Club Sacramento
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout Nick Alex\nNick Alex is a stand-up comedian known for his sharp wit\, clever observations\, and engaging stage presence. His comedy blends personal storytelling with astute cultural commentary\, delivered with a confident\, conversational style that resonates with audiences of all backgrounds. \nHe has performed at comedy clubs and festivals across the country\, building a loyal following through his relatable and consistently funny material. Fans can expect a polished\, entertaining set full of laughs from start to finish. \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, August 20\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM (Doors open at 6:30 PM)\nVenue: Punch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento\nAddress: 2100 Arden Way\, Sacramento\, CA 95825\nAge Restriction: 18+ / 2 Beverage Minimum \nAbout the Venue\nPunch Line Comedy Club Sacramento is one of the most beloved comedy venues in Northern California. Located at 2100 Arden Way in Sacramento\, this intimate club has hosted some of the biggest names in stand-up comedy for decades. \nThe venue features a cozy\, club-style layout with general admission and preferred seating options\, a full bar\, and the classic two-drink minimum. Every seat offers a great view of the stage\, and the warm atmosphere makes for a perfect night out. Parking is available in the surrounding shopping center lot. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is a solo headline stand-up performance by Nick Alex. Expect an evening of sharp\, engaging comedy in an intimate club setting. Shows run approximately 75–90 minutes. The 18+ policy and beverage minimum are in effect. \nTicket Information\nTickets range from approximately $40 – $62 (all-in pricing\, fees included before taxes). \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/nick-alex-live-at-punch-line-comedy-club-sacramento/
