SUMMARY:Gary Owen: No Hard Feelings Tour LIVE at DeVos Performance Hall
DESCRIPTION:Official Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nAbout Gary Owen\nGary Owen is one of America’s most beloved stand-up comedians\, known for his high-energy performances and his unique ability to connect with audiences of all backgrounds. The Cincinnati native first gained national attention as the “Funniest Serviceman in America” after winning the Armed Forces Entertainment competition\, and he has been making audiences roar with laughter ever since. \nOwen has appeared in numerous films and television shows\, including Think Like a Man\, Think Like a Man Too\, Ride Along\, and Little. He has released multiple stand-up specials on Showtime and Netflix\, and his comedy style — which blends personal stories\, cultural observations\, and sharp wit — has earned him a massive and loyal fan base across the country. \nThe No Hard Feelings Tour is Gary Owen’s latest stand-up tour\, and it promises to be one of his most personal and hilarious shows yet. Fans can expect an evening of non-stop laughter as Gary shares stories from his life\, his family\, and his unique perspective on the world. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Thursday\, August 20\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM EDT\nVenue: DeVos Performance Hall\, 303 Monroe NW\, Grand Rapids\, MI 49503\nTour: No Hard Feelings Tour\n\nAbout the Venue\nDeVos Performance Hall is one of Grand Rapids’ most prestigious and beloved performance venues\, located at 303 Monroe NW in the heart of downtown. With a seating capacity of approximately 2\,400\, the hall offers an elegant\, theater-style setting with excellent acoustics and sightlines from every seat. \nThe venue is home to the Grand Rapids Symphony and regularly hosts Broadway touring productions\, comedy shows\, and major entertainment events. The hall features comfortable theater seating\, multiple bars and concession areas\, and a grand lobby perfect for pre-show mingling. Parking is available in nearby downtown garages\, and the venue is easily accessible from major highways. \nDeVos Performance Hall is operated by ASM Global and is consistently recognized as one of the finest performing arts venues in the Midwest. Seeing Gary Owen here means experiencing his comedy in a world-class setting with exceptional sound quality. \nWhat to Expect\nGary Owen’s No Hard Feelings Tour is a full evening of stand-up comedy featuring his signature high-energy style and crowd-pleasing humor. The show runs approximately 90 minutes and is intended for mature audiences. \nOwen is known for his ability to work a crowd and make every audience member feel like they’re part of the show. His performances are spontaneous\, energetic\, and filled with the kind of authentic storytelling that has made him one of the most popular comedians on the touring circuit today. \nExpect stories about family\, relationships\, and the hilarious realities of everyday life — all delivered with Gary’s trademark enthusiasm and infectious energy. This is a show you won’t want to miss. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $35 – $85 (before fees) \nPurchase official tickets directly through Ticketmaster\, or find resale tickets through VividSeats. Both options are available below. \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/gary-owen-no-hard-feelings-tour-live-at-devos-performance-hall/
LOCATION:DeVos Performance Hall\, 303 Monroe NW\, Grand Rapids\, Michigan\, 49503\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://comedycalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/6eb4a789-e1f0-4d3c-aa1e-fca35eff7abf_CUSTOM-BnhDtc.jpg
