SUMMARY:Lavell Crawford LIVE at Chicago Improv
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nLavell Crawford LIVE at Chicago Improv\nLavell Crawford brings his legendary stand-up comedy to the Chicago Improv in Schaumburg for a night of non-stop laughs. Best known for his role as Huell on “Breaking Bad” and “Better Call Saul\,” Crawford is one of the most beloved comedians working today\, delivering big laughs with his larger-than-life personality. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, August 21\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM (Doors: 5:00 PM)\nVenue: Chicago Improv\nAddress: 5 Woodfield Mall K120B\, Schaumburg\, IL 60173\nAge Requirement: 21+ (Valid ID required)\nSeating: General Admission (first-come\, first-served)\nMinimum: 2-item food/drink minimum per person \nAbout Lavell Crawford\nLavell Crawford is a stand-up comedian and actor best known for playing Huell Babineaux on AMC’s “Breaking Bad” and “Better Call Saul.” A veteran of the comedy circuit\, Crawford has appeared on “Last Comic Standing” and released multiple stand-up specials. His warm\, self-deprecating humor and infectious energy make him a fan favorite wherever he performs. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHilarious self-deprecating stand-up comedy\nStories from his time on Breaking Bad and Better Call Saul\nWarm\, crowd-pleasing humor for all comedy fans\nIntimate comedy club atmosphere at Chicago Improv\nFull food and drink service (2-item minimum)\n21+ event — valid photo ID required\n\nVenue Information\nChicago Improv is located inside Woodfield Mall in Schaumburg\, IL\, one of the premier comedy clubs in the Chicago area. The venue offers a full menu and bar service in an intimate showroom setting perfect for live comedy. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at $39.77. Available through Ticketmaster and VividSeats. All sales are final. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you.\nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
