SUMMARY:Nikki Glaser: The Stunning Tour LIVE at Ovens Auditorium (Night 2)
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nNikki Glaser is one of the sharpest\, most fearless voices in stand-up comedy today. Known for her razor-sharp wit\, brutally honest self-deprecation\, and unapologetically bold humor\, Glaser has become one of the most talked-about comedians in the country. From her acclaimed Netflix specials to her viral Golden Globes hosting performance\, Nikki Glaser is everywhere — and for good reason. \nHer 2026 Stunning Tour is her most ambitious stand-up run yet\, selling out theaters across North America and Europe. Glaser’s comedy is equal parts confessional and confrontational — she goes places other comedians won’t\, and she does it with a smile that makes you feel like you’re in on the joke. Expect material on relationships\, pop culture\, body image\, and the absurdity of modern life\, all delivered with her signature precision and charm. \nThis is Night 2 of a two-night stand in Charlotte. Whether you missed Night 1 or just can’t get enough\, this is your second chance to catch one of comedy’s hottest tours live. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Friday\, August 21\, 2026\nDoors Open: 6:00 PM EDT\nShow Time: 7:00 PM EDT\nVenue: Ovens Auditorium\, 2900 E Independence Boulevard\, Charlotte\, NC 28205\nTicket Price Range: $65 – $588+\nContent Warning: Adult language and mature themes\n\nAbout the Venue\nOvens Auditorium is one of Charlotte’s most beloved and storied performance venues\, located at 2900 E Independence Boulevard. With a seating capacity of approximately 2\,600 guests\, it offers an intimate yet grand theater experience with excellent sightlines from every section. \nThe venue features Orchestra\, Mezzanine\, and Balcony seating sections\, all with clear views of the stage. Ovens Auditorium is managed by Blumenthal Performing Arts and is known for its warm acoustics\, classic architecture\, and the kind of close-to-the-performer atmosphere that makes live comedy feel electric. \nParking is available on-site and in nearby lots along E Independence Boulevard. The venue is easily accessible by car from Uptown Charlotte and surrounding areas. Arrive early to find your seats and settle in before showtime. \nWhat to Expect\nNikki Glaser’s Stunning Tour is a solo stand-up performance featuring all-new material. Glaser is celebrated for her ability to make audiences laugh at things they’d normally be too embarrassed to admit they find funny — her comedy is cathartic\, confessional\, and completely captivating. \nExpect a high-energy\, fast-paced show with sharp punchlines\, unexpected tangents\, and the kind of crowd energy that only comes from seeing a comedian at the absolute peak of their powers. Friday night crowds bring extra energy\, and Glaser always delivers. \nThis is a solo headlining show. The show is expected to run approximately 75–90 minutes. Seating is reserved — arrive on time to settle in before the lights go down. \nTicket Information\nTickets range from $65 to $588+ depending on section and availability. Purchase official tickets directly through Ticketmaster\, or find resale tickets through VividSeats. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/nikki-glaser-the-stunning-tour-live-at-ovens-auditorium-night-two/
LOCATION:Ovens Auditorium\, 2900 E Independence Boulevard\, Charlotte\, NC\, 28205\, United States
