SUMMARY:Nurse John LIVE at Brea Improv
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets (Ticketmaster) \nResale Tickets (VividSeats) \nNurse John LIVE at Brea Improv\nViral comedian and TikTok sensation Nurse John (John Dela Cruz) brings his hilarious stand-up comedy to the Brea Improv in August 2026. \nKnown for his relatable healthcare humor and viral social media content\, Nurse John has built a massive following with his unique comedic perspective. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, August 21\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM PDT (Doors open at 6:00 PM)\nVenue: Brea Improv\nAddress: 180 S Brea Blvd\, Brea\, CA 92821\nAge Requirement: 21+\nSeating: General Admission\, first-come first-served\nNote: Two-item minimum purchase required \nAbout Nurse John\nNurse John (John Dela Cruz) is a comedian and TikTok sensation known for his viral healthcare humor. His comedy is described as “like a mental breakdown at work” — leaving audiences crying\, screaming\, and laughing simultaneously. He has built a massive social media following and is one of the fastest-rising comedians in the country. \nWhat to Expect\n\nViral TikTok humor brought to life on stage\nRelatable healthcare and everyday life comedy\nIntimate club setting at the Brea Improv\nTwo shows available Friday night\n21+ show with full bar and two-item minimum\n\nVenue Information\nBrea Improv is located at 180 S Brea Blvd in Brea\, CA. Part of the legendary Improv comedy club chain in Orange County\, CA. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at $35 (plus fees). \nOfficial Tickets (Ticketmaster) \nResale Tickets (VividSeats) \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
